  fallbackName: Bolts
  fallbackDescription: 'Bolts secure the Hub3 bearing assembly to the vehicle knuckle
    and ensure the unit remains firmly fixed during operation. They maintain structural
    stability, support load transfer, and prevent movement or misalignment while
    the wheel rotates.


    Check for: correct torque, no thread damage, no corrosion,
    no cracks, no bending, proper seating against the mounting surface, and no loosening.'
